  "resume": "This is a television report from Blickpunkt (episode 388/1037) dated 22 November 1978, covering the takeover of the Schuler spinning mill in Rüti, GL, by a Panamanian company and the preservation of 70 jobs. The footage includes statements from Ernst Seibert, factory workers, and representatives of the Lalkaka family, as well as scenes of the factory, surrounding village, and textile products."
 },
